Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.40,0:00:03.98,Black,,0,0,0,,Umayuru: Pretty Gray
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.61,0:00:05.98,Black,,0,0,0,,Beleza!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.70,0:00:08.91,draw-white,draw,0,0,0,,{\alpha&H00&\an7\fscx100\fscy100\p1\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(192,180)}m 0 -1 l -1 105 l 472 105 l 439 52 l 473 0 m 266 198
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.70,0:00:08.91,textbox,textbox,0,0,0,,{\fs70\c&HD3814B&\pos(353.32,228.73)}Oguri Cap
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.70,0:00:08.91,draw-white,draw,0,0,0,,{\alpha&H00&\an7\fscx100\fscy100\p1\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(1338,864)}m 0 -1 l -1 105 l 472 105 l 439 52 l 473 0 m 266 198
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.70,0:00:08.91,textbox,textbox,0,0,0,,{\fs70\c&HD3814B&\pos(1559.32,908.73)}Tamamo Cross
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.98,0:00:10.50,Black,,0,0,0,,A nossa barraca de takoyaki DEFINITIVAMENTE vai ser a estrela da Feira Solefall!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.62,0:00:12.22,Black,,0,0,0,,Dá uma olhada nos nossos competidores, Oguri!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.22,0:00:14.46,Black,,0,0,0,,Ninguém foi tão longe na decoração como a gente!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.46,0:00:16.91,Black,,0,0,0,,Não vai ser nem um desafio!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.25,0:00:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fnPermanent Marker\pos(978,342)}Takoyaki
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.91,0:00:18.68,Black,,0,0,0,,Bwahaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.71,0:00:20.66,Black,,0,0,0,,Sim. Fizemos um bom trabalho.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.66,0:00:23.38,Black,,0,0,0,,Parece que a chapa está quente e pronta para o show!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.38,0:00:23.98,Black,,0,0,0,,Ah?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.98,0:00:25.30,Black,,0,0,0,,O que é essa sensação...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.30,0:00:28.06,Black,,0,0,0,,Someone's got the heat cranked up high as us!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.06,0:00:28.83,Black,,0,0,0,,Alguém está tão aquecida como a gente!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.23,0:00:29.34,draw-white,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&H00&\an7\fscx100\fscy100\p1\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(1344,852)}m 0 -1 l -1 105 l 472 105 l 439 52 l 473 0 m 266 198
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.23,0:00:29.34,textbox,,0,0,0,,{\fs70\c&H5F46DB&\pos(1559.32,902.73)}Gold Ship
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.09,0:00:31.55,Black,,0,0,0,,Entendi o que você está fazendo...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.55,0:00:34.16,Black,,0,0,0,,Você está tentando dizer que o seu yakisoba vai roubar a cena.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.16,0:00:36.32,Black,,0,0,0,,Não é mesmo, Golshi?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.32,0:00:37.64,Black,,0,0,0,,...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.02,0:00:41.53,Black,,0,0,0,,O que foi? Está com medo de desafiar nosso takoyaki?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.83,0:00:43.18,Black,,0,0,0,,Abra seus olhos, garota.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.18,0:00:45.49,Black,,0,0,0,,Estou tentando ver o que não pode ser visto.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.49,0:00:47.36,Black,,0,0,0,,O que não pode ser... o quê?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.98,0:00:50.99,Black,,0,0,0,,O-o que é isso?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.99,0:00:53.02,Black,,0,0,0,,Se você olha para o abismo macarrônico...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.02,0:00:56.61,Black,,0,0,0,,O abismo macarrônico olha de volta para você.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.61,0:00:58.30,Black,,0,0,0,,Espera, o que isso quer dizer?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.65,0:01:03.73,Black,,0,0,0,,Que coisa... E aqui estou eu preparando os ingredientes enquanto você fica fazendo bobagens por aí.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.56,0:01:00.54,draw-white,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&H00&\an7\fscx100\fscy100\p1\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(1328,102)}m 0 -1 l -1 105 l 472 105 l 439 52 l 473 0 m 266 198
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.56,0:01:00.54,textbox,,0,0,0,,{\fs70\c&HBFB805\pos(1551.32,148.73)}Mejiro McQueen
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.73,0:01:07.18,Black,,0,0,0,,Ah é? E porque você está com essa trena aí?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.42,0:01:11.35,Black,,0,0,0,,Bem, ouvi dizer que o repolho no yakisoba precisa ser cortado em pedaços pequenos para a boca...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.69,0:01:15.62,Black,,0,0,0,,Mas nenhuma medida foi dada então eu vou apenas medir a sua boca.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.62,0:01:17.56,Black,,0,0,0,,Você nunca cozinhou na sua vida?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.81,0:01:18.70,Black,,0,0,0,,Que seja.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.70,0:01:20.97,Black,,0,0,0,,Não é problema nosso.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.97,0:01:22.99,Black,,0,0,0,,Ei Oguri, venha experimentar um pouco!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.99,0:01:23.98,Black,,0,0,0,,É pra já.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.58,0:01:27.64,Black,,0,0,0,,Eu disse um POUCO, Oguri! POUCO!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.23,0:01:30.66,Black,,0,0,0,,Oh, opa. Estava tão gostoso que não consegui me aguentar...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.66,0:01:31.21,Black,,0,0,0,,...Ué?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.87,0:01:34.74,Black,,0,0,0,,Eu sempre gostei da sua comida, mas...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.74,0:01:39.18,Black,,0,0,0,,Estar aqui do seu lado, comendo o seu takoyaki quentinho...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.18,0:01:40.74,Black,,0,0,0,,Faz o meu coração ficar bem mais aquecido.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.32,0:01:44.34,Black,,0,0,0,,Oh, é mesmo? uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.34,0:01:45.70,Black,,0,0,0,,E-eu acho que posso deixar passar então...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.70,0:01:47.14,Black,,0,0,0,,A hora está próxima!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.84,0:01:49.70,Black,,0,0,0,,Parece que elas estão começando.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.17,0:01:52.66,Black,,0,0,0,,...Então é melhor eu aumentar a marc—
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.84,0:01:54.12,Black,,0,0,0,,Ah, não!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.12,0:01:56.30,Black,,0,0,0,,Acabou o molho!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.30,0:01:58.36,Black,,0,0,0,,A gente deve ter acabado com tudo enquanto experimentávamos!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.36,0:01:59.90,Black,,0,0,0,,E  agora?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.06,0:02:02.83,Black,,0,0,0,,Não dá para fazer takoyaki sem molho...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.83,0:02:03.98,Black,,0,0,0,,RAAAAAH!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.03,0:02:07.21,Black,,0,0,0,,Não podemos ter caras tristes em um festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.54,0:02:09.30,Black,,0,0,0,,Vamos lá, vamos trabalhar juntas!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.20,0:02:12.65,Black,,0,0,0,,Valeu, Golshi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.82,0:02:16.73,Black,,0,0,0,,Nosso takoyakisoba vai ser o melhor!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.73,0:02:18.90,Black,,0,0,0,,Hrraaaaah... YAH!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.20,0:02:25.24,Black,,0,0,0,,É um sabor bom e único!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.70,0:02:28.24,Black,,0,0,0,,Alguém está com fome?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.24,0:02:31.24,Black,,0,0,0,,[Nosso Takoyakisoba]\NVenha comer nosso delicioso takoyakisoba!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.06,0:00:24.77,Black,,0,0,0,,{\fnPermanent Marker\pos(1002,204)}Meu Yakisoba
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.77,0:00:27.58,Black,,0,0,0,,{\fnPermanent Marker\move(1002,204,1002,934)}Meu Yakisoba
